  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a contributor, I want the app test job to be deterministic, so that a red run means a real failure.\n\n`TopicRowActionsTests/aRemovalInFlightIsNotSentTwice()` fails intermittently under load: 2 of 5 runs alone on an iPad simulator, and also on an iPhone clone in full runs of two unrelated branches (LOT-155, LOT-127). Not measured on a clean dev-swift.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] The test waits on a condition, not on timing (see #467, #514).\n- [ ] 20 runs in a row pass on iPhone and iPad.",
  "closed_by": null,
