   "body": "Another occurrence (2026-11-12/13): `TopicRowActionsTests.aRemovalInFlightIsNotSentTwice` failed twice on #804 (runs 43311366056, 43315855588), once on #809 and once on #810. Each time it passed on a re-run (#804: run 43315855588, attempt 2). Per the harness rule, a re-run that turns green is a bug, not a pass: this issue stays open for the fix.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
